      "def": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.get_public_setting(k text)\n RETURNS jsonb\n LANGUAGE plpgsql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public'\nAS $function$\r\nbegin\r\n  if k not in (\r\n    'announcement','social','payment','reviews',\r\n    'pay_methods','promos','site'\r\n  ) then\r\n    return null;\r\n  end if;\r\n  return (select value from public.settings where key = k limit 1);\r\nend;\r\n$function$\n",
